        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Life here revolves around the Khao Sok rainy season, which effects many parts of daily life. Therefore, before you book your ticket, I recommend doing a bit of research. We're here to help you understand the Khao Sok weather. Khao Sok national park weather can effect your options. Officially, we can divide Khao Sok weather into three seasons: The Hot Season, from March to May The Monsoon Season (Khao Sok rainy season), from June to October The Dry Season, from November to February (Read our guide to Khao Sok Dry season) However, the weather conditions closely [...]
